<div class="article-route" id="article-route" hidden>
  <div class="article-loading outer-container" id="article-loading" role="status">
    문서를 불러오는 중입니다.
  </div>

  <div class="article-error outer-container" id="article-error" hidden>
    <p class="article-error__label">문서</p>
    <h1 id="article-error-title">문서를 열 수 없습니다.</h1>
    <p id="article-error-message">잠시 후 다시 시도하거나 검색에서 다른 문서를 찾아보세요.</p>
    <div class="article-error__actions">
      <button class="button" id="article-retry" type="button">다시 시도</button>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="/search">검색</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="article-page outer-container" id="article-page" hidden>
    <header class="article-header">
      <h1 id="article-title"></h1>
    </header>

    <details class="article-toc-mobile" id="article-toc-mobile" hidden>
      <summary>목차</summary>
      <nav aria-label="문서 목차" data-toc></nav>
    </details>

    <div class="article-layout">
      <aside class="article-toc" id="article-toc" hidden>
        <p>목차</p>
        <nav aria-label="문서 목차" data-toc></nav>
      </aside>

      <article class="article-prose" id="article-body"></article>
    </div>

    <footer class="article-footer">
      <section class="article-related" id="article-related" aria-labelledby="article-related-title" hidden>
        <h2 id="article-related-title">관련 문서</h2>
        <ul id="article-related-list"></ul>
      </section>

      <a class="article-graph-link" id="article-graph-link" href="/graph">
        <span>그래프에서 보기</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M4 10h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <dialog class="image-viewer" id="image-viewer" aria-labelledby="image-viewer-title" aria-describedby="image-viewer-caption">
    <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="image-viewer-title">이미지 크게 보기</h2>
    <div class="image-viewer__bar">
      <p id="image-viewer-caption"></p>
      <button type="button" id="image-viewer-close" aria-label="이미지 닫기">닫기</button>
    </div>
    <div class="image-viewer__stage">
      <img id="image-viewer-image" src="" alt="" />
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>
